Source: rebuild
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Elias Bakken <elias@iagent.no>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/intelligent-agent/Rebuild

Package: rebuild-recore
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dnsmasq-base, network-manager, udev
Description: Recore board support for Rebuild images
 Board identity tools (serial number, revision), the USB gadget serial
 console, and the Wi-Fi hotspot fallback. Installed on every Rebuild
 image, barebone included.

Package: rebuild-printer
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, rebuild-recore (= ${binary:Version}), gpiod,
 plymouth, python3, stm32flash, usbutils
Description: Printer layer for Rebuild images
 Tools that flash the Recore's AR100, STM32 and RP2040 firmware, the
 build configurations for that firmware, the first-boot service, SSH
 auto-disable, the Recore boot splash, and the system settings the
 fluidd, mainsail and octoprint images share.
